The '''2022 Wigan Metropolitan Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Wigan Metropolitan Borough Council]] in England. This election was held on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]]. A by-election was held on the same day in Leigh East ward to fill the seat left vacant by the death of [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour]] councillor Anita Thorpe.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.wigantoday.net/news/politics/council/sadness-at-death-of-kind-and-caring-wigan-councillor-3550966 |title=Sadness at death of 'kind and caring' Wigan councillor|website=Wigan Today|access-date=5 April 2022}}</ref>

